{"no":16,"title":"A Polite Request","titleZh":"彬彬有礼的要求","audio":"audio/L16.mp3","duration":88.35,"question":{"en":"What was the polite request?","zh":"那个彬彬有礼的要求是什么？"},"sentences":[{"i":0,"t":14.07,"t2":19.46,"en":"What was the polite request?","zh":"那个彬彬有礼的要求是什么？","meta":true},{"i":1,"t":19.46,"t2":23.61,"en":"If you park your car in the wrong place,","zh":"一旦你把汽车停错了地方，","chunks":[{"c":"VP","x":"park car","g":"动词短语"},{"c":"PP","x":"in the wrong place","g":"介词短语作定语/表语"},{"c":"NP","x":"the wrong place","g":"冠词+形+名"},{"c":"NP","x":"your car","g":"名词短语"}],"pat":"主谓宾","gp":["一般现在时","主谓宾句型"]},{"i":2,"t":23.61,"t2":28.2,"en":"a traffic policeman will soon find it.","zh":"交通警很快就会发现的。","chunks":[{"c":"VP","x":"will soon find it","g":"情态谓语"},{"c":"NP","x":"a traffic policeman","g":"冠词+名"}],"pat":"主谓宾","gp":["一般将来时","情态动词 will","主谓宾句型"]},{"i":3,"t":28.2,"t2":30.59,"en":"You will be very lucky","zh":"你会非常走运的，","chunks":[{"c":"VP","x":"will be lucky","g":"情态谓语"},{"c":"ADJP","x":"very lucky","g":"形容词短语"}],"pat":"主系表","gp":["一般将来时","情态动词 will","主系表句型"]},{"i":4,"t":30.59,"t2":34.71,"en":"if he lets you go without a ticket.","zh":"如果他没给你开罚单就让你走了。","chunks":[{"c":"PP","x":"without a ticket","g":"介词短语作定语/表语"},{"c":"SBAR","x":"you go without a ticket","g":"宾语从句"},{"c":"NP","x":"a ticket","g":"冠词+名"}],"pat":"主谓","gp":["一般现在时","宾语从句","不定式"]},{"i":5,"t":34.71,"t2":39.64,"en":"However, this does not always happen.","zh":"然而，情况并不都是这样。","chunks":[{"c":"VP","x":"However does not always happen","g":"动词短语"}],"pat":"主谓+状语","gp":["否定的 not","主谓+状语句型"]},{"i":6,"t":39.64,"t2":44.94,"en":"Traffic police are sometimes very polite.","zh":"交通警有时也很客气。","chunks":[{"c":"VP","x":"are sometimes polite","g":"动词短语"},{"c":"ADJP","x":"very polite","g":"形容词短语"},{"c":"NP","x":"Traffic police","g":"名词作定语/专名"}],"pat":"主系表","gp":["一般现在时","主系表句型"]},{"i":7,"t":44.94,"t2":48.14,"en":"During a holiday in Sweden,","zh":"有一次在瑞典度假，","chunks":[{"c":"PP","x":"During a holiday in Sweden","g":"介词短语作定语/表语"},{"c":"PP","x":"in Swe